ude content (what, not how) • All data and copy • Brand colors #99EA48 and #010205, and Plus Jakarta Sans • Media: logo, social logos, icons • Default Button\" 24,57 596x120 :: • Frame name\n• Must-include content (what, not how)\n• All data and copy\n• Brand colors #99EA48 and #010205, and Plus Jakarta Sans\n• Media: logo, social logos, icons\n• Default Button\n      FRAME 3:46 \"Yours (designer decides)\" 668,0 644x261\n        TEXT 3:47 \"Yours (designer decides)\" 24,24 197x23 :: Yours (designer decides)\n        TEXT 3:48 \"• Layout, grid, grouping, order and emphasis of every section • All other colors: neutrals, text, light / dark section backgrounds, surfaces, borders, chart and progress colors, selected filter, error / disabled • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: current filter, card hover, expanded / collapsed FAQ, hover • Header with dropdown triggers, stat and chart cards, client wordmark row, video block, filter tags, case-study card, testimonial with pager, FAQ accordion, article card, CTA banner, footer • How image placeholders are sized and placed\" 24,57 596x180 :: • Layout, grid, grouping, order and emphasis of every section\n• All other colors: neutrals, text, light / dark section backgrounds, surfaces, borders, chart and progress colors, selected filter, error / disabled\n• Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation\n• All states: current filter, card hover, expanded / collapsed FAQ, hover\n• Header with dropdown triggers, stat and chart cards, client wordmark row, video block, filter tags, case-study card, testimonial with pager, FAQ accordion, article card, CTA banner, footer\n• How image placeholders are sized and placed\n  FRAME 3:49 \"How it is evaluated\" 64,2963 1312x259\n    TEXT 3:50 \"How it is evaluated\" 0,0 222x35 :: How it is evaluated\n    TEXT 3:51 \"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\" 0,51 1312x22 :: Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\n    TEXT 3:52 \"1. Checklist coverage 2. Data & copy accuracy 3. Information hierarchy across sections 4. Visual quality & consistency of your own system 5. Component reuse 6. State design (current filter, card hover, expanded FAQ)\" 0,89 1312x132 :: 1. Checklist coverage\n2. Data & copy accuracy\n3. Information hierarchy across sections\n4. Visual quality & consistency of your own system\n5. Component reuse\n6. State design (current filter, card hover, expanded FAQ)\n    TEXT 3:53 \"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 1 named frame, your components.\" 0,237 1312x22 :: Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 1 named frame, your components."}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"e112ad43-99b8-4e41-abe8-11c3137ce110"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01RhLZHnkcyCsL6VvwRhMbST","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
